## Position size and risk

How large one position is, the largest exposure the strategy can hold at once,
and where it stops out. Unless `config.yaml` sets a `position` section, the
toolkit sizes each position at 10% of equity. The largest exposure must fit
under `risk_config.max_total_notional` in `run.yaml`, and under any exposure
limit set by whoever deploys the strategy; a strategy that sits near such a
limit keeps tripping it.

